  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Other Clans of Judah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The descendants of Judah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Perez, Hezron, Karmi, Hur and Shobal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reaiah son of Shobal was the father of Jahath, and Jahath the father of Ahumai and Lahad. These were the clans of the Zorathites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the sons",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of Etam:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jezreel, Ishma and Idbash. Their sister was named Hazzelelponi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Penuel was the father of Gedor, and Ezer the father of Hushah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 4:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "These were the descendants of Hur, the firstborn of Ephrathah and father",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of Bethlehem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashhur the father of Tekoa had two wives, Helah and Naarah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarah bore him Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni and Haahashtari. These were the descendants of Naarah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Helah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zereth, Zohar, Ethnan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Koz, who was the father of Anub and Hazzobebah and of the clans of Aharhel son of Harum.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jabez was more honorable than his brothers. His mother had named him Jabez,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "saying, \"I gave birth to him in pain.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jabez cried out to the God of Israel, \"Oh, that you would bless me and enlarge my territory! Let your hand be with me, and keep me from harm so that I will be free from pain.\" And God granted his request.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelub, Shuhah's brother, was the father of Mehir, who was the father of Eshton.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshton was the father of Beth Rapha, Paseah and Tehinnah the father of Ir Nahash.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the men of Rekah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Kenaz:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Othniel and Seraiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 4:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Othniel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hathath and Meonothai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meonothai was the father of Ophrah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 4:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Seraiah was the father of Joab,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the father of Ge Harashim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "It was called this because its people were skilled workers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Caleb son of Jephunneh:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iru, Elah and Naam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 4:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The son of Elah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kenaz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Jehallelel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ziph, Ziphah, Tiria and Asarel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Ezrah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jether, Mered, Epher and Jalon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 4:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "One of Mered's wives gave birth to Miriam, Shammai and Ishbah the father of Eshtemoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the children of Pharaoh's daughter Bithiah, whom Mered had married.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "1CH 4:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "His wife from the tribe of Judah gave birth to Jered the father of Gedor, Heber the father of Soko, and Jekuthiel the father of Zanoah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Hodiah's wife, the sister of Naham:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 4:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the father of Keilah the Garmite, and Eshtemoa the Maakathite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
